                    <nc xml:id="m-93a83ac6-0fe1-4b76-9ee4-3e413bea81e2" pname="d" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-f4094b30-9a12-4d18-b725-3c7d6644a69c">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-45cf112c-f15c-40b0-8a55-e21f715ac272" type="clivis" xml:id="m-cefbd563-ac3d-4b81-a886-5107695b394c">
                    <nc xml:id="m-667f9cef-5e13-4b6f-9974-c96df0a2f077" pname="d" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-26d8bd19-ffdf-4cf3-bb54-3dda78d1650e" pname="c" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-9a43cb6d-908d-4121-94d4-998e29de4ebb" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-d47551c8-f025-4de0-abef-e0bac59f4695" facs="#m-33d3deb6-b1fd-4a97-8acb-415280ccd772" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-842ba427-f2d1-492c-8039-559f2595511b">
              <lg xml:id="m-cab8d82b-9f6a-46e8-830e-2315ede17ab6">
                <l xml:id="m-205bd87b-de6d-42b2-94cc-3ff4274a2085" facs="#m-12db1aaa-74fa-49d1-a219-335117d96a19" label="text-like">The Mass of the Holy oul¬¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b8f28e7-376f-4e99-992a-f50dc2f383f2" facs="#m-6c21a3e4-78d3-4916-ba52-f6a94fea99f7" label="ambiguous">cel</l><l xml:id="m-fd730cf5-14ea-4989-9567-50f7ad74a9ca" facs="#m-9504d8b0-7b88-4844-9c6e-9946f48f42df" label="text-like">THE MASS OF THE HOLY OLS</l><l xml:id="m-91051ecd-ad22-4187-bba1-7e0fe8f62a1a" facs="#m-d5c307a6-cdca-488a-a183-97fce3a4cf84" label="text-like">The blessing of the oil of catechumens and the oil of the sick and the</l><l xml:id="m-5858cb4e-38d0-40b3-b892-8ec134079da9" facs="#m-c3d73c32-22ef-4c62-b504-c1bb6924f979" label="text-like">consecration of Chrism take place during Mass in accordance with the</l><l xml:id="m-963a3f7c-2dab-437d-9e6f-f93be8137cb9" facs="#m-cdcfe133-eb0c-4f04-aa91-b597a6d875c6" label="text-like">Roman Pontifical, except for uohat is indicated below.</l><l xml:id="m-83f705c3-fd71-45dc-a11d-8fe0aa46afb9" facs="#m-9e8a37a8-e8e8-4b80-af1b-716762179216" label="text-like">This blessing and the makine of Chrism tate place durine this Mass of</l><l xml:id="m-ee7e0ec9-42af-4c74-82fc-dd594abe2744" facs="#m-88a864e1-bb5b-4669-a977-f191453b1956" label="text-like">the Holy Oils, vohich is to be celebrated after Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-e6b8718f-b198-4c9f-8273-813df49fd89c" facs="#m-865759de-c052-4784-ae64-343a854a580f" label="text-like">When the procession enters the church, the Introit antiphon is sung, and</l><l xml:id="m-4d934afd-6f5d-4bd1-b71f-28ca28a6e892" facs="#m-19aa2729-6fe1-4b45-94e9-44e1900428a7" label="ambiguous">its psalm.</l><l xml:id="m-a6775e77-3e7e-4461-a33a-f1f21b131598" facs="#m-1cc482e4-df6b-4e15-8bf7-fe918fc5168c" label="lyrics-like">The psalm Júdica me, Deus, and Glória Pátri, are omitted.</l><l xml:id="m-6347f9bf-5159-476a-b5c4-54e4e70695d5" facs="#m-e48f2ac3-74dd-45e8-978c-1399bea057dd" label="text-like">ENTRY ANTIPHON</l><l xml:id="m-9c889729-70fc-41b7-b4ca-6dde27e1edc3" facs="#m-04e4a25c-6260-4611-8482-23b49228f3ea" label="ambiguous">F</l><l xml:id="m-52636e17-b52c-481d-b7ff-0ddc4bddf378" facs="#m-a21b67dd-92b8-410e-9c3f-e6073f89a1e3" label="ambiguous">uncti- onis</l><l xml:id="m-e3cc2911-5486-4f16-8095-0d46fe4fab7e" facs="#m-e22c220d-f054-4558-a492-3309a185c65c" label="lyrics-like">ódle- um, et fí-li-is</l><l xml:id="m-50b25feb-059d-4a03-a2d7-92f60e3407a4" facs="#m-c6ac3ecb-81e9-4342-8f78-c1f6e368dd0d" label="ambiguous">Aci-es</l><l xml:id="m-fb997b95-38fa-472b-b475-927dfa98e543" facs="#m-8a520ee2-aa2c-42bd-b349-76223159bb87" label="lyrics-like">Isra-el dí- ces: Hoc ó-le-um uncti-o- nis sánctum</l><l xml:id="m-f9ef5fd6-969b-44d0-ae65-de75b6119ece" facs="#m-b9321e5b-0e58-4c53-bf77-cddf7889f3a3" label="lyrics-like">é- rit mí- hi in ge- ne-ra-ti-ónes vé-stras. Ps. Grá-ti¬as</l><l xml:id="m-1130bc0b-3434-48e5-b23e-5abfa2354c99" facs="#m-9435bf1d-5b8d-4655-8f58-7572f5e7e629" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-f0ff2163-7194-4bd9-b9e3-749f51dfc91c" facs="#m-19650edf-a5c1-46cc-8e79-c85707a445ee" label="lyrics-like">in aetérnum cantábo; “ per ómnes gene-ra¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b59b566-9998-4ed6-b059-46b2444351e5" facs="#m-563f2dde-a824-43ff-ada5-18f6f410e1b6" label="lyrics-like">ti-ónes annunti-ábo fide-li-tá-tem tú¬ am. Fáci-es.</l><l xml:id="m-d2552adb-5359-4200-b648-8806dc8ae752" facs="#m-40e67cdb-c7d4-40f7-b635-43c2f69dc14a" label="text-like">Kyrie IV is sung.</l><l xml:id="m-c3146714-1831-4cc9-a388-b07a26ef93fb" facs="#m-ae584583-8a67-41b7-b757-2cedcd8ad3d9" label="lyrics-like">When the Introit and Kyrie are finished, the bishop intones the Glória in</l><l xml:id="m-c0ba736c-986d-4c2d-9242-c9e8947ccdf1" facs="#m-c974d2cb-9fdc-417d-abb4-3c62961dc893" label="lyrics-like">excélsis to the solemn tone.</l><l xml:id="m-f052b46c-9d9b-4a5e-b0a3-d2aba52a47bc" facs="#m-927d4224-fcf2-4acd-b5ac-5f53080a725e" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-cc571de9-7920-4ebc-8c1b-87e3cfba45f1" facs="#m-25b7d0e4-6b80-48f5-a178-b2a111a57f53" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-ef7def7f-c0e8-4533-a31f-955860361af7" facs="#m-410edfe2-2456-4785-9bea-fbb2c8c57cf2" label="ambiguous">LOmine Deus, qui in regene¬</l><l xml:id="m-93ab1880-8379-4561-8e4d-ec5188cd5746" facs="#m-a261adcc-5bab-4485-9aa5-e25317be6087" label="lyrics-like">grátiae tuae, in diébus nostris.</l><l xml:id="m-f6474698-e09c-4ace-b0c1-73d3b90db16c" facs="#m-dfda8cac-7f74-4ca4-8a5a-5c3fea58ea08" label="lyrics-like">Urándis plébibus tuis mini¬</l><l xml:id="m-9051a09a-906a-4387-b2ca-72b5745f7f1b" facs="#m-dd8fd166-b3c2-44d3-8945-a57d6086a94f" label="lyrics-like">et méritis et número sacrátus</l><l xml:id="m-4ae7fea7-a5d0-453d-b2dd-bdaf070a96e1" facs="#m-183ac8bb-b912-4dc8-a818-ff5b75cdbba1" label="lyrics-like">stério úteris sacerdótum; tribue</l><l xml:id="m-4cb5ecd7-0817-43d6-b63e-adc7e2d0de48" facs="#m-92a80e8c-f722-4aa7-8543-4f21d5759356" label="lyrics-like">tibi pópulus augeátur. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-68afd1f9-9b4d-4fe3-90d2-d19715fcb105" facs="#m-d7a50fa0-98e1-47d8-be2c-9d50a3c2dce5" label="lyrics-like">nobis perseverántem in tua vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf23c959-3f85-448a-aaed-16f90e6bbabc" facs="#m-817566dd-41a5-47a1-8c45-1a1a0e132b34" label="ambiguous">num nostrum Jesum Christum</l><l xml:id="m-b3192a42-c95d-4886-9846-4d81c389f543" facs="#m-142dc94c-62a5-4721-a251-09fd953c3432" label="lyrics-like">luntáte famulátum; f ut dono! Filium tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-c6615e65-5c81-4cc9-8a75-731f4931b133" facs="#m-0b6843c2-df17-4dc5-8281-b03adb7c0643" label="text-like">This Collect only is said.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>